      "product_summary": "Slip-on outdoor casual shoes with elastic side gores and a closed upper. A front pull strip and heel loop give the wearer a grip while putting the shoe on. The deeply segmented sole creates a distinctive profile in Black and Grey.\nBlack, Grey; EU 39-48 provide color and size choices for wholesale assortments.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Share footwear specifications, quantities, packaging needs and destination for review and quotation. Company images introduce company activities and order coordination."
